<header class="ref-head"><span class="hero-ornament"></span><h1 class="research-title">26 November in history</h1><p class="ref-lede">4 events that happened on 26 November, from 1778 to 1965.</p></header>
<ol class="day-events"><li class="tih-event-card"><p class="tih-event-year">1778</p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Captain Cook sights Maui on his return to Hawaii</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">On his second visit to the Hawaiian Islands, which he called the Sandwich Islands, James Cook sighted Maui. He was killed at Kealakekua Bay on Hawaii Island less than three months later.</p></li><li class="tih-event-card"><p class="tih-event-year">1922</p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Howard Carter looks into Tutankhamun's tomb</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Howard Carter made a small hole in the sealed doorway and peered in by candlelight. Asked if he could see anything, he reportedly replied, 'Yes, wonderful things.'</p></li><li class="tih-event-card"><p class="tih-event-year">1942</p><h2 class="tih-event-title">Casablanca premieres in New York</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">Casablanca, starring Humphrey Bogart and Ingrid Bergman, premiered at the Hollywood Theatre weeks after the Allies landed in North Africa. It won three Academy Awards, including Best Picture.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/new-york">New York</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/theatre">Theatre</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/allies">Allies</a></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><p class="tih-event-year">1965</p><h2 class="tih-event-title">France launches its first satellite</h2><p class="tih-event-desc">A French Diamant rocket launched the satellite Astérix from Hammaguir in Algeria. France became the third country, after the Soviet Union and the United States, to put a satellite into orbit on its own rocket.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/soviet-union">Soviet Union</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/algeria">Algeria</a></div></li></ol>
